13.1.1 Linux
------------

The Linux (x86_64/aarch64) wheels require one of

   * MPICH(1) or any other ABI-compatible derivative, like MVAPICH(2),
     Intel MPI(3), HPE Cray MPICH(4)

   * Open MPI(5) or any other ABI-compatible derivative, like NVIDIA
     HPC-X(6)

Users may need to set the ‘LD_LIBRARY_PATH’ environment variable such
that the dynamic linker is able to find at runtime the MPI shared
library file (‘libmpi.so.*’).

