13.1.2 macOS
------------

The macOS (arm64/x86_64) wheels require

   * MPICH(1) or Open MPI(2) installed (either manually or via a package
     manager) in the standard system prefix ‘/usr/local’

   * MPICH(3) or Open MPI(4) installed via Homebrew(5) in the default
     prefix ‘/opt/homebrew’

   * MPICH(6) or Open MPI(7) installed via MacPorts(8) in the default
     prefix ‘/opt/local’

